OL,3,GNEWSAHenry hoover superfan, 8, shows
OL,4,Aoff collection
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn eight-year-old Henry hoover superfan
OL,7,Fhas been gifted a limited edition
OL,8,Fvacuum cleaner in honour of the
OL,9,Fcompany's 45th anniversary.
OL,11,FTed, from Melksham in Wiltshire, has
OL,12,Famassed a collection of 35 Henrys since
OL,13,Fhis "hyper-fixation" began three years
OL,14,Fago, with the oldest dating back to
OL,15,F1989.
OL,17,FHe was presented with one of only 1,000
OL,18,Fspecial edition vacuums during a tour
OL,19,Fof the Numatic International factory in
OL,20,FChard, Somerset, to mark National
OL,21,FManufacturing Day earlier.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
